guide butler-routes-completionist/riverglades-horde
title Riverglades (Horde)
levels 35-45
zone Riverglades
faction Horde
category Leveling
folder Completionist
coords live
version 1

# The Horde side is run from Krom'rosh command (Krom'rosh, Kreza,
# Gorg, Tran'gul, Tan'jani, the wanted boards), then the western
# Twilight front (Da'grosh, Crag'rog), the central pairs (Neza, the
# carcass, Tan'jani), Powderfuse Port (Friz), the north-east (Clugfist,
# Jezap, Gobam, Na'zok, Hamur) and the expedition leg for the chain
# that leaves the zone. Every Horde accept in the local census (66
# quests, docs/riverglades-horde-census.md) appears exactly once as an
# accept and once as a turnin, except 95181 which names no ender in the
# data. The 29 shared quests stay with the main guide's contract.
# Sourceless and spawnless-sourced objectives complete at the giver
# with bag notes, never invented points.

step Krom'rosh command - mustering

  accept 93786 -- A Message in Blood - Krom'rosh; farmhands, the east fields
  accept 93787 -- Food for the Taking - Krom'rosh; feed satchels, farmed below
  note 93787's satchels have no dropper and no vendor anywhere in the data - have six in your bags.
  complete 93787
  accept 93788 -- Borrowed Blades - Kreza Darkthorn; woodworker's axes, the mill
  accept 93971 -- Farholde Scouting Report - Krom'rosh holds the word
  note 93971 names no giver in the data - Krom'rosh offers it at the command.
  accept 94973 -- Krol'dok Moulding - Kreza Darkthorn holds the mould
  note 94973 names no giver in the data - Kreza offers it at the command.
  note 94974's pre (94973 above) fills at Kreza's - take it there.
  accept 95936 -- Hail the Dragonslayer - Krom'rosh holds the word
  note 95936 names no giver in the data - Krom'rosh offers it at the command; Scaldaron waits on the far west coast below.
  accept 95882 -- WANTED: Scoutmaster Vargas - the wanted board; Vargas's eye, the north-east
  note Scoutmaster Vargas is elite: grouping is advised.
  accept 95992 -- WANTED: Ghostmaw - the wanted board; Ghostmaw's fang, the center
  note Ghostmaw is elite: grouping is advised.
  accept 95181 -- Twilight Scouting Report - the report; no giver in the data
  note 95181 names no giver and no ender in the data - take it and carry on.
  accept 95951 -- Fetch 'n' Fletch - Tan'jani; stickin' spears, farmed below
  note 95951's spears have no dropper and no vendor anywhere in the data - have twenty in your bags.
  complete 95951
  accept 95033 -- On the Other Side - Tan'jani; Uzer'i takes it far away, late

step The east fields - farmhands and satchels

  complete 93786 @45.33,84.11 -- Meadowsbrook Farmhands off the farmhands for Krom'rosh
  complete 93786 @47.12,80.86 -- Meadowsbrook Farmhands off the farmhands for Krom'rosh
  turnin 93786 -- A Message in Blood - back to Krom'rosh
  turnin 93787 -- Food for the Taking - the satchels to Krom'rosh
  turnin 93971 -- Farholde Scouting Report - back to Krom'rosh
  note 94480's and 94483's pres (93787 and 93786 plus 93787 above) fill here - take both after it.
  accept 94480 -- A Gift From Our Enemies - Krom'rosh; Gorg takes it by the command
  accept 94483 -- Show Them How It's Done - Krom'rosh; priests and scouts, the center

step The mill and the center - axes, priests and trainees

  collect 263972 x10 quest 93788.1 @35.55,61.05 -- Woodworker's Axes off the Turner's Mill Lumberjacks for Kreza Darkthorn
  turnin 94480 -- A Gift From Our Enemies - Krom'rosh's word to Gorg
  note 94481's pre (94480 above) fills here - take 94481 after it.
  accept 94481 -- A Serving of Strength - Gorg; Rog'mar trainees, the south flats
  complete 94483 @44.04,62.48 -- Farholde Priests off the priests for Krom'rosh
  complete 94483 @45.18,66.79 -- Farholde Scouts off the scouts for Krom'rosh
  complete 94481 @52.28,51.83 -- Rog'mar Trainees off the trainees for Gorg
  turnin 93788 -- Borrowed Blades - the axes to Kreza Darkthorn
  note 93976's pre (93788 above) fills here - take 93976 after it.
  accept 93976 -- The Goblin Trader - Kreza Darkthorn; Friz takes it at the port, east
  turnin 94481 -- A Serving of Strength - back to Gorg
  turnin 94483 -- Show Them How It's Done - back to Krom'rosh
  note 94672's and 94680's pres (94483 above) fill here - take both after it.
  accept 94672 -- Encroaching Twilight - Tran'gul; raiders and shadowmancers, the west camp
  accept 94680 -- Twilight Missives - Tran'gul; missives off the shadowmancers, west

step The west Twilight camp - raiders and missives

  complete 94672 @33.61,43.39 -- Twilight Raiders off the raiders for Tran'gul
  complete 94672 @40.32,48.69 -- Twilight Shadowmancers off the shadowmancers for Tran'gul
  complete 94672 @37.16,44.95 -- Twilight Neophytes off the neophytes for Tran'gul
  collect 265745 x3 quest 94680.1 @40.32,48.69 -- Twilight Missives off the Twilight Shadowmancers for Tran'gul
  turnin 94672 -- Encroaching Twilight - back to Tran'gul
  turnin 94680 -- Twilight Missives - back to Tran'gul
  note 94727's pre (94672 and 94680 above) fills here - take 94727 after it.
  accept 94727 -- Digging for Answers - Tran'gul; Clubtoe takes it by the camp
  turnin 94727 -- Digging for Answers - Tran'gul's word to Clubtoe
  note 95417's and 95602's pres (94727 above) fill here - take both after it.
  accept 95417 -- The Purple Ones - Clubtoe; the Brute takes it by the camp
  accept 95602 -- Sickening Lights - Clubtoe; the lights, the camp

step The brute - ritualists and heads

  turnin 95417 -- The Purple Ones - Clubtoe's word to the Twilight Brute
  note 95601's pre (95417 above) fills here - take 95601 after it.
  accept 95601 -- The Purple Ones - the Twilight Brute; brutes and ritualists, the camp
  complete 95601 @44.14,49.67 -- Empowered Brutes off the brutes for the Twilight Brute
  complete 95601 @44.96,51.18 -- Twilight Ritualists off the ritualists for the Twilight Brute
