  turnin 95602 -- Sickening Lights - back to Clubtoe
  note 95427's pre (95601 and 95602 above) fills here - take 95427 after it.
  accept 95427 -- Twilight No More! - Clubtoe; Chogg'Zac's heads, the ogre camp
  note Chogg'Zac is elite: grouping is advised.
  kill 256899 optional -- Chogg'Zac, for the Heads of Chogg'Zac
  collect 265750 quest 95427.1 @44.33,50.01 optional -- Chogg's Head off Chogg'Zac for Clubtoe
  collect 265751 quest 95427.2 @44.33,50.01 optional -- Zac's Head off Chogg'Zac for Clubtoe
  turnin 95427 -- Twilight No More! - back to Clubtoe
  note 95418's pre (95427 above) fills here - take 95418 after it.
  accept 95418 -- Spread the Word - Clubtoe; Tran'gul takes it east
