  accept 95183 -- Step One: Rock - Hamur; good rocks, the giant grounds
  note Gorgegut and Hamur both offer 95183 - Hamur's copy is the one to take, since the turn-in lives with him.
  note 95183's rocks have no dropper and no vendor anywhere in the data - have ten Good Rocks in your bags.
  turnin 95183 -- Step One: Rock - the rocks to Hamur
  note The Eye rides south - Neza's word is on the way.
  turnin 95882 -- WANTED: Scoutmaster Vargas - the Eye to Neza Bloodsnout

step Hamur - more rock (Blacksmithing)

  when skill Blacksmithing 1

  note 96026's pre (95183 far above) fills at Hamur's - take it there.
  accept 96026 optional -- Step Two: More Rock - Hamur; weightstones, farmed below
  note 96026 needs Blacksmithing to finish - take it with the trade.
  note Heavy Weightstones have no dropper in the data - craft or bring ten in your bags.
  turnin 96026 optional -- Step Two: More Rock - the stones to Hamur

