step Krom'rosh command - the mould, the crate and the close

  turnin 94973 -- Krol'dok Moulding - the mould to Kreza Darkthorn
  note 94974's pre (94973 above) fills here - take 94974 after it.
  accept 94974 optional -- Key Ingredients - Kreza Darkthorn; leather and iron bars, farmed below
  note 94974 needs Blacksmithing to finish - take it with the trade.
  note Thick Leather has no vendor in the Glades (Lhara sells it off-zone) and Iron Bars come off no line here - have four leather and twelve bars in your bags.
  when skill Blacksmithing 1
  turnin 94974 optional -- Key Ingredients - the leather and iron to Kreza Darkthorn
  turnin 95062 -- Frazzlespark's Crate - Friz's word to Krom'rosh
  turnin 95936 -- Hail the Dragonslayer - the Head to Krom'rosh

step Expedition - map 1444, Uzer'i's word

  zone map 1444

  turnin 95033 -- On the Other Side - Tan'jani's word to Witch Doctor Uzer'i
  zone map 2548

step Riverglades - done

  note The Glades are held: Krom'rosh commands, the Twilight falls west and east, Neza runs the gnolls. The Alliance side belongs to the main guide.
